{"step_index":117,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:01:30Z","thinking":"**Designing the Admin Dashboard**\n\nPlanning the structure of the admin dashboard. Will include cards for key metrics: total users, pharmacies, verified pharmacies, total medicines, medicine reports, and active alerts. The dashboard also requires charts visualizing reports by category, pharmacy registrations by area/division, and medicines by therapeutic category, utilizing Chart.js. Finally, including an admin pharmacy approval section with a pending pharmacies table and approve/reject functionality.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Admin Oversight Portal - MedCheck BD</title>\n  <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <!-- Chart.js -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.1/dist/chart.umd.min.js\"></script>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-light\">\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Navbar -->\n  <div id=\"mainNavbar\"></div>\n\n  <main class=\"py-5\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <!-- Header -->\n      <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center mb-4 gap-3\">\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"badge bg-danger bg-opacity-10 text-danger fw-bold text-uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-pill mb-1\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-shield-alt me-1\"></i> Central Governance Portal\n          </span>\n          <h2 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-0\">System Administration & Oversight</h2>\n          <small class=\"text-muted\">Review pharmacy approvals, medicine registries, safety reports, and access logs.</small>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"d-flex gap-2\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-primary-custom btn-sm\" data-bs-toggle=\"modal\" data-bs-target=\"#addMedicineModal\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-plus me-1\"></i> Register New Medicine\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- KPI Metric Cards -->\n      <div class=\"row g-3 mb-4\">\n        <div class=\"col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-6\">\n          <div class=\"card-custom p-3 bg-white text-center\">\n            <span class=\"text-muted small fw-bold\">Total Users</span>\n            <h3 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-0 mt-1\" id=\"adminStatUsers\">0</h3>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-6\">\n          <div class=\"card-custom p-3 bg-white text-center\">\n            <span class=\"text-muted small fw-bold\">Pharmacies</span>\n            <h3 class=\"fw-bold text-primary mb-0 mt-1\" id=\"adminStatPharmacies\">0</h3>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-6\">\n          <div class=\"card-custom p-3 bg-white text-center\">\n            <span class=\"text-muted small fw-bold\">Verified Stores</span>\n            <h3 class=\"fw-bold text-success mb-0 mt-1\" id=\"adminStatVerified\">0</h3>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-6\">\n          <div class=\"card-custom p-3 bg-white text-center\">\n            <span class=\"text-muted small fw-bold\">Medicines</span>\n            <h3 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-0 mt-1\" id=\"adminStatMedicines\">0</h3>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-6\">\n          <div class=\"card-custom p-3 bg-white text-center\">\n            <span class=\"text-muted small fw-bold\">Reports Filed</span>\n            <h3 class=\"fw-bold text-warning mb-0 mt-1\" id=\"adminStatReports\">0</h3>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-6\">\n          <div class=\"card-custom p-3 bg-white text-center\">\n            <span class=\"text-muted small fw-bold\">Active Alerts</span>\n            <h3 class=\"fw-bold text-danger mb-0 mt-1\" id=\"adminStatAlerts\">0</h3>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Chart.js Visualizations Section -->\n      <div class=\"row g-4 mb-5\">\n        <div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n          <div class=\"card-custom p-4 bg-white h-100\">\n            <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-chart-pie text-danger me-2\"></i>Reports by Category</h6>\n            <div style=\"height: 250px;\">\n              <canvas id=\"reportsCategoryChart\"></canvas>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n          <div class=\"card-custom p-4 bg-white h-100\">\n            <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-chart-bar text-primary me-2\"></i>Pharmacies by Location</h6>\n            <div style=\"height: 250px;\">\n              <canvas id=\"pharmacyAreaChart\"></canvas>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n          <div class=\"card-custom p-4 bg-white h-100\">\n            <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-pills text-success me-2\"></i>Medicines by Category</h6>\n            <div style=\"height: 250px;\">\n              <canvas id=\"medicineCategoryChart\"></canvas>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Section: Pending Pharmacy Approvals -->\n      <div class=\"card-custom p-4 bg-white mb-5\">\n        <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3\">\n          <div>\n            <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-0\"><i class=\"fas fa-user-check text-success me-2\"></i>Pending Pharmacy Applications</h5>\n            <small class=\"text-muted\">Inspect DGDA drug licenses and authorize Verified Pharmacy credentials.</small>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm\" onclick=\"loadPendingPharmacies()\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-sync-alt me-1\"></i> Refresh\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-custom align-middle mb-0\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Pharmacy Trade Name</th>\n                <th>Owner / Manager</th>\n                <th>Drug License</th>\n                <th>Area / Division</th>\n                <th>Status</th>\n                <th class=\"text-end\">Verification Action</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody id=\"pendingPharmaciesTable\">\n              <tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"text-center py-3 text-muted\">Checking pending registrations...</td></tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Section: Suspicious Medicine Reports -->\n      <div class=\"card-custom p-4 bg-white mb-5\">\n        <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3\">\n          <div>\n            <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-0\"><i class=\"fas fa-exclamation-triangle text-danger me-2\"></i>Suspicious Medicine Community Reports</h5>\n            <small class=\"text-muted\">Investigate consumer reports and adjust status to alert pharmacies.</small>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm\" onclick=\"loadAdminReports()\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-sync-alt me-1\"></i> Refresh\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-custom align-middle mb-0\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Report ID</th>\n                <th>Medicine & Batch</th>\n                <th>Issue Category</th>\n                <th>Incident Details</th>\n                <th>Review Status</th>\n                <th class=\"text-end\">Action</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody id=\"adminReportsTable\">\n              <tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"text-center py-3 text-muted\">Loading reports...</td></tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Section: Medicine Registry Management -->\n      <div class=\"card-custom p-4 bg-white mb-5\">\n        <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3\">\n          <div>\n            <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-0\"><i class=\"fas fa-database text-primary me-2\"></i>Official Medicine Reference Registry</h5>\n            <small class=\"text-muted\">Manage DAR registration codes, reference pricing, and manufacturers.</small>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-primary-custom btn-sm\" data-bs-toggle=\"modal\" data-bs-target=\"#addMedicineModal\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-plus me-1\"></i> Add Medicine\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-custom align-middle mb-0\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Medicine Name</th>\n                <th>Generic Name</th>\n                <th>Manufacturer</th>\n                <th>DAR Reg No</th>\n                <th>Ref Price</th>\n                <th>Status</th>\n                <th class=\"text-end\">Action</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody id=\"adminMedicinesTable\">\n              <tr><td colspan=\"7\" class=\"text-center py-3 text-muted\">Loading medicines...</td></tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Section: Security & Access Audit Logs -->\n      <div class=\"card-custom p-4 bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3\">\n          <div>\n            <h5 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-0\"><i class=\"fas fa-shield-virus text-info me-2\"></i>Live Medical Security & Access Logs</h5>\n            <small class=\"text-muted\">Real-time audit trail of medicine searches, verifications, sales, and administrative modifications.</small>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm\" onclick=\"loadAccessLogs()\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-sync-alt me-1\"></i> Refresh Logs\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-custom table-sm align-middle mb-0 font-monospace\" style=\"font-size: 0.84rem;\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Time</th>\n                <th>Action</th>\n                <th>User / Role</th>\n                <th>Resource</th>\n                <th>Audit Details</th>\n                <th>IP Address</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody id=\"accessLogsTable\">\n              <tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"text-center py-3 text-muted\">Streaming access logs...</td></tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- MODAL: Add New Medicine -->\n  <div class=\"modal fade\" id=\"addMedicineModal\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <div class=\"modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg\">\n      <div class=\"modal-content border-0 shadow-lg\">\n        <div class=\"modal-header bg-primary text-white\">\n          <h5 class=\"modal-title fw-bold\"><i class=\"fas fa-pills me-2\"></i>Register Medicine in Central Database</h5>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close btn-close-white\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\"></button>\n        </div>\n        <form id=\"adminAddMedicineForm\" onsubmit=\"handleAdminAddMedicine(event)\">\n          <div class=\"modal-body\">\n            <div class=\"row g-3 mb-3\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Brand Name *</label>\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"adminMedName\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"e.g. Napa 500 mg\" required>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Generic Composition *</label>\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"adminMedGeneric\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"e.g. Paracetamol\" required>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"row g-3 mb-3\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Manufacturer *</label>\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"adminMedManufacturer\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"e.g. Beximco Pharmaceuticals Ltd.\" required>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Strength *</label>\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"adminMedStrength\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"e.g. 500 mg\" required>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"row g-3 mb-3\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n                <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Dosage Form</label>\n                <select id=\"adminMedDosageForm\" class=\"form-select\">\n                  <option value=\"Tablet\">Tablet</option>\n                  <option value=\"Capsule\">Capsule</option>\n                  <option value=\"Syrup\">Syrup</option>\n                  <option value=\"Suspension\">Suspension</option>\n                  <option value=\"Injection\">Injection</option>\n                </select>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n                <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Therapeutic Category *</label>\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"adminMedCategory\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"e.g. Analgesics\" required>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n                <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">Reference Price (৳) *</label>\n                <input type=\"number\" step=\"0.01\" id=\"adminMedPrice\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"1.20\" required>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"mb-3\">\n              <label class=\"form-label fw-bold text-navy small\">DGDA DAR Registration Number *</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"adminMedRegNo\" class=\"form-control font-monospace\" placeholder=\"e.g. DAR-012-0045\" required>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"modal-footer\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light btn-sm\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\">Cancel</button>\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary-custom btn-sm\">Add to Database</button>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Footer -->\n  <div id=\"mainFooter\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Scripts -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/main.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/auth.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"js/admin.js\"></script>\n  <script>\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n      initAdminDashboard();\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Create Admin Dashboard page (admin-dashboard.html) with Chart.js analytics, pharmacy approvals, and security audit logs","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\medcheck-bd\\client\\admin-dashboard.html","toolAction":"Create client/admin-dashboard.html","toolSummary":"Create admin-dashboard.html"}}]}
